# Transfer the person to another sheet (by id). Anyone but a steward, a retired person, this sheet's own id, an
# archived sheet, or a name or alias already on another sheet of the other sheet's tree is refused (400); a person not
# on the sheet (404). The person arrives on the other sheet with their grades, terms, contact, aliases and claims
# (renumbered there; figures a statement bound and references lost) and leaves this sheet entirely. When someone on
# the other sheet has their name or one of their aliases as a name or alias, the arriving person is merged into them,
# as a merge does (refused when that is more than one person or a retired one); otherwise a contact already there is
# refused. Each sheet records the transfer (the other sheet then the merge), followed by its rollup.
